  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 3 of the Community-Based Adaptation Programme in Southeast Asia and Pacific (CBA Phase 3). The CBA Phase 3 will directly contribute to the second pillar of UNDP Local Action framework by contributing to strengthen socio-ecological resilience of targeted land/seascapes and local communities. Further, CBA Phase 3 will align with UNDP&#x2019;s Local Action in identifying and carrying out landscape level actions and partnerships, as appropriate, to support the implementation of UNFCCC Nationally Det</narrative>
  </description>
